    {
      "_id": "rHwlDG85kUcrUFdg",
      "_key": "!actors.items!mmStoneGolem0000.rHwlDG85kUcrUFdg",
      "name": "Slow (save)",
      "type": "action",
      "img": "icons/magic/time/clock-stopwatch-white-blue.webp",
      "system": {
        "active": true,
        "description": "<p>You alter time around up to six creatures of your choice in a 40-foot Cube within range. Each target must succeed on a Wisdom saving throw or be affected by this spell for the duration.</p><p>An affected target's Speed is halved, it takes a −2 penalty to AC and Dexterity saving throws, and it can't take Reactions. On its turns, it can take either an action or a Bonus Action, not both, and it can make only one attack if it takes the Attack action. If it casts a spell with a Somatic component, there is a 25 percent chance the spell fails as a result of the target making the spell's gestures too slowly.</p><p>An affected target repeats the save at the end of each of its turns, ending the spell on itself on a success.</p><section id=\"secret-2RobIVhv3tn7gmU7\" class=\"secret\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>The inline roll above will return 1 if it succeeded or 0 if it failed.</p></section>",
        "definition": {
          "schemaVersion": 1,
          "id": "action:srd-slow",
          "tags": [
            "spell"
          ],
          "costs": {
